  "_comment": "ADAPT MODE ON A SOLANA HOME. The tokenized stock ALREADY EXISTS as an SPL mint on Solana, so the OFT is initialised as an adapter that locks it in escrow instead of minting a new one; the issuer keeps the mint and its authority. Diff against localnet-solana-home.json: the name and token.existingToken. Create the pre-existing mint first with `npm run deploy:legacy -- --config config/localnet-solana-home.json`.",
